==Restrictions==
*This stage uses [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1 deploy costs.

==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Catclaw Castle (Enemy Base)|Catclaw Castle]].
*1 [[Doge]] spawns after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*8 [[Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*4 [[Snache]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns as the boss after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage. Keep spamming [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cats]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cats]], and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cats]] to win.

==Hint==
This hint only appears as a defeat message upon losing the stage.
*Visit previously cleared stages to get more XP.<br>Use XP to level up units and<br>make them even stronger!

